    "title": "SDK卡片-03-IDataModel字段与分录",
    "kind": "knowledge",
    "content": "---\ntitle: \"SDK卡片-03-IDataModel字段与分录\"\ndate: 2026-10-28\ntags:\n  - kingdee/sdk\n  - cosmic/v7_0_1\ndocument_version: \"Cosmic V7.0.1\"\ntarget_environment_version: \"7.0.16（用户提供；本资料未证明兼容）\"\ncoverage: \"official_detail_read\"\nsources:\n  - \"https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel\"\n---\n\n# SDK卡片-03-IDataModel字段与分录\n\n> [!info] 版本范围\n> 下面的行为摘要与签名来自已读取的官方 V7.0.1 页面。当前环境标称 7.0.16，仍需以实际 JAR、插件绑定与回归结果核对。\n\n## `kd.bos.entity.datamodel.IDataModel`\n\n模型层按字段标识读写值；根实体、分录、子分录分别使用不同索引参数。getDataEntity() 在缓存情形可能不包含分录，可检查带 includeEntry 的重载。新增多行可用 batchInsertEntryRow。字段标识与实体结构应先通过元数据核实。\n\n来源：[IDataModel 官方详情](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel)；读取日期：2026-10-28。\n\n```java\npublic interface IDataModel extends kd.bos.entity.datamodel.IEntryOperate, kd.bos.entity.datamodel.IDataProvider, kd.bos.entity.cache.TableCache, kd.bos.entity.datamodel.IEntryFilter\n```\n\n已核实的相关签名：\n\n- `int[] batchInsertEntryRow(java.lang.String entryKey, int row, int rowCount)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel#batchInsertEntryRow-java.lang.String-int-int-)\n- `java.lang.Object createNewData(java.lang.Object newObject)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel#createNewData-java.lang.Object-)\n- `java.lang.Object createNewData()` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel#createNewData--)\n- `DynamicObject getDataEntity()` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel#getDataEntity--)\n- `DynamicObject getDataEntity(boolean includeEntry)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel#getDataEntity-boolean-)\n- `java.lang.Object getValue(java.lang.String propName)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel#getValue-java.lang.String-)\n- `java.lang.Object getValue(java.lang.String propName, int rowIndex)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel#getValue-java.lang.String-int-)\n- `default java.lang.Object getValue(java.lang.String propName, int rowIndex, int parentRowIndex)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel#getValue-java.lang.String-int-int-)\n- `void setValue(java.lang.String propName, java.lang.Object value)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.kddm&package=kd.bos.entity.datamodel&name=IDataModel#setValue-java.lang.String-java.lang.Object-)\n- `void setValue(java.lang.String propName, java.lang.Object value, int rowI"
