    "title": "SDK卡片-08-DynamicObject动态实体数据包",
    "kind": "knowledge",
    "content": "---\ntitle: \"SDK卡片-08-DynamicObject动态实体数据包\"\ndate: 2026-10-28\ntags:\n  - kingdee/sdk\n  - cosmic/v7_0_1\ndocument_version: \"Cosmic V7.0.1\"\ntarget_environment_version: \"7.0.16（用户提供；本资料未证明兼容）\"\ncoverage: \"official_detail_read\"\nsources:\n  - \"https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject\"\n---\n\n# SDK卡片-08-DynamicObject动态实体数据包\n\n> [!info] 版本范围\n> 下面的行为摘要与签名来自已读取的官方 V7.0.1 页面。当前环境标称 7.0.16，仍需以实际 JAR、插件绑定与回归结果核对。\n\n## `kd.bos.dataentity.entity.DynamicObject`\n\nDynamicObject 承载 ORM 动态实体数据；按属性名访问字段前可用 containsProperty 检查。普通值、引用实体、分录集合分别有类型化读取方法。类型和字段定义来自 DynamicObjectType。某个对象是否可修改保存，还取决于它是查询、缓存还是完整加载数据包。\n\n来源：[DynamicObject 官方详情](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject)；读取日期：2026-10-28。\n\n```java\npublic class DynamicObject extends kd.bos.dataentity.entity.DataEntityBase implements java.io.Serializable\n```\n\n已核实的相关签名：\n\n- `public final boolean containsProperty(java.lang.String propertyName)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject#containsProperty-java.lang.String-)\n- `public final java.lang.Object get(java.lang.String propertyName)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject#get-java.lang.String-)\n- `public final java.lang.Object get(int index)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject#get-int-)\n- `public final java.lang.Object get(kd.bos.dataentity.metadata.IDataEntityProperty dp)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject#get-kd.bos.dataentity.metadata.IDataEntityProperty-)\n- `public kd.bos.dataentity.entity.DynamicObject getDynamicObject(java.lang.String propertyName)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject#getDynamicObject-java.lang.String-)\n- `public kd.bos.dataentity.entity.DynamicObject getDynamicObject(int index)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject#getDynamicObject-int-)\n- `public kd.bos.dataentity.entity.DynamicObject getDynamicObject(kd.bos.dataentity.metadata.IDataEntityProperty dp)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject#getDynamicObject-kd.bos.dataentity.metadata.IDataEntityProperty-)\n- `public kd.bos.dataentity.entity.DynamicObjectCollection getDynamicObjectCollection(java.lang.String propertyName)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.dataentity&package=kd.bos.dataentity.entity&name=DynamicObject#getDynamicObjectCollection-java.lang.String-)\n- `public kd.bos."
