    "title": "SDK卡片-14-OperationServiceHelper操作执行与RPC",
    "kind": "knowledge",
    "content": "---\ntitle: \"SDK卡片-14-OperationServiceHelper操作执行与RPC\"\ndate: 2026-10-28\ntags:\n  - kingdee/sdk\n  - cosmic/v7_0_1\ndocument_version: \"Cosmic V7.0.1\"\ntarget_environment_version: \"7.0.16（用户提供；本资料未证明兼容）\"\ncoverage: \"official_detail_read\"\nsources:\n  - \"https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.operation&name=OperationServiceHelper\"\n---\n\n# SDK卡片-14-OperationServiceHelper操作执行与RPC\n\n> [!info] 版本范围\n> 下面的行为摘要与签名来自已读取的官方 V7.0.1 页面。当前环境标称 7.0.16，仍需以实际 JAR、插件绑定与回归结果核对。\n\n## `kd.bos.servicehelper.operation.OperationServiceHelper`\n\nexecuteOperate 根据操作标识与实体编码调用操作服务，可传数据包或内码数组。官方说明其内部可能远程 RPC、本地 RPC 或直接调用，入参是否被修改、事务是否同属一个范围会不同。操作后需要继续处理数据时，应按实际调用模式重新加载并核对状态。\n\n来源：[OperationServiceHelper 官方详情](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.operation&name=OperationServiceHelper)；读取日期：2026-10-28。\n\n```java\npublic class OperationServiceHelper\n```\n\n已核实的相关签名：\n\n- `public static OperationResult executeOperate(java.lang.String operationKey, java.lang.String entityNumber, DynamicObject[] dataEntities, OperateOption option)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.operation&name=OperationServiceHelper#executeOperate-java.lang.String-java.lang.String-DynamicObject%5B%5D-OperateOption-)\n- `public static OperationResult executeOperate(java.lang.String operationKey, java.lang.String entityNumber, java.lang.Object[] ids, OperateOption option)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.operation&name=OperationServiceHelper#executeOperate-java.lang.String-java.lang.String-java.lang.Object%5B%5D-OperateOption-)\n\n关联：[[00-资料总览]]、[[01-覆盖范围与版本核对]]。\n"
