    "content": "---\ntitle: \"SDK卡片-22-PermissionServiceHelper功能验权\"\ndate: 2026-10-28\ntags:\n  - kingdee/sdk\n  - cosmic/v7_0_1\ndocument_version: \"Cosmic V7.0.1\"\ntarget_environment_version: \"7.0.16（用户提供；本资料未证明兼容）\"\ncoverage: \"official_detail_read\"\nsources:\n  - \"https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.permission&name=PermissionServiceHelper\"\n  - \"https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.permission&package=kd.bos.permission.model.perm.req&name=CheckPermissionReq\"\n---\n\n# SDK卡片-22-PermissionServiceHelper功能验权\n\n> [!info] 版本范围\n> 下面的行为摘要与签名来自已读取的官方 V7.0.1 页面。当前环境标称 7.0.16，仍需以实际 JAR、插件绑定与回归结果核对。\n\n## `kd.bos.servicehelper.permission.PermissionServiceHelper`\n\n验权参数包括用户、应用、实体及权限项；不同重载分别处理无隔离维度、业务单元与组织职能、多隔离对象等场景，返回类型也不同。四参数 boolean 重载不考虑隔离维度。功能权限与数据范围应分别按接口契约处理，不能由一个布尔验权推定全部数据可见。\n\n来源：[PermissionServiceHelper 官方详情](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.permission&name=PermissionServiceHelper)；读取日期：2026-10-28。\n\n```java\npublic class PermissionServiceHelper\n```\n\n已核实的相关签名：\n\n- `public static boolean checkPermission(java.lang.Long userId, java.lang.String appId, java.lang.String entityNum, java.lang.String permItemId)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.permission&name=PermissionServiceHelper#checkPermission-java.lang.Long-java.lang.String-java.lang.String-java.lang.String-)\n- `public static PermResult checkPermission(CheckPermissionReq req)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.permission&name=PermissionServiceHelper#checkPermission-CheckPermissionReq-)\n- `public static int checkPermission(java.lang.Long userId, java.lang.Long orgId, java.lang.String orgViewType, java.lang.String appId, java.lang.String entityNum, java.lang.String permItemId)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.permission&name=PermissionServiceHelper#checkPermission-java.lang.Long-java.lang.Long-java.lang.String-java.lang.String-java.lang.String-java.lang.String-)\n- `public static int checkPermission(java.lang.Long userId, java.util.Map<java.lang.Long,java.lang.String> orgIdViewTypeMap, java.lang.String appId, java.lang.String entityNum, java.lang.String permItemId)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.permission&name=PermissionServiceHelper#checkPermission-java.lang.Long-java.util.Map%3Cjava.lang.Long-java.lang.String%3E-java.lang.String-java.lang.String-java.lang.String-)\n- `public static int checkPermission(java.lang.Long userId, java.lang.String dimType, java.util.List<java.lang.Long> dimObjIds, java.lang.String appId, java.lang.String entityNum, java.lang.String permItemId)` · [原文](https://dev.kingdee.com/sdk/Cosmic%20V7.0.1/index.html?nav=class&module=kd.bos.servicehelper&package=kd.bos.servicehelper.permission&name=PermissionServiceHelper#chec"
